WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.360
In this lesson, you will learn to turn a picture storyboard into code, block by block.

2
00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:11.170
A storyboard is a row of pictures that shows what happens, in order.

3
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:16.900
For each picture, ask: does the character move, talk, or change?

4
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.420
Each picture becomes one or two blocks.

5
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:26.830
Run your code and compare it with the storyboard.

6
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:31.400
Storyboard: 🐰💬“Hungry!” → ➡️➡️➡️ → 🥕 pick up → 🔼 grow.

7
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.350
Your code matches the storyboard!

8
00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:37.530
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

9
00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:42.300
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
